    "clock": "best routed ASAP7 record per block from results/physical_abi3/asap7 (closed first, else fastest routed); each record's fmax is 1/(target - WNS) at the target it was routed at, so a record from a loose target is a lower bound",
    "profile_cycles_vs_reported": "profile counts from start to done (12,962,353); the driver's \"cycles\" (12,973,713) also counts reset, image load and placement load"
  },
